       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.    TMASTER1.
       AUTHOR.        R L ENSMINGER.
       INSTALLATION.  GTR.
       DATE-COMPILED.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-AS400.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER. IBM-AS400.

       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT TERMINAL-FILE
           ASSIGN TO WORKSTATION-ZMASTER-SI
           ORGANIZATION IS TRANSACTION
           ACCESS IS SEQUENTIAL.

       EJECT
       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD  TERMINAL-FILE
           LABEL RECORDS ARE OMITTED.
       01  TERMINAL-REC.
           COPY DD-SCREEN1 OF ZMASTER.

       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.

       COPY CATREAD OF COPYCSIS.
       01  FALS-VAL                           PIC 1 VALUE B"0".
       01  GOBACK-SW                          PIC X.
       01  SCREEN-INDICATORS.
           05 IND OCCURS 99 TIMES             PIC 1 INDICATOR 01.
       01  TRUE-VAL                           PIC 1 VALUE B"1".

       EJECT
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       OPEN-PAR.
           OPEN I-O TERMINAL-FILE.
           MOVE SPACES TO TERMINAL-REC.
           MOVE 0 TO FILEOPTION OF SCREEN1-O.

           MOVE ALL B"0" TO SCREEN-INDICATORS.
           MOVE "N" TO GOBACK-SW.
           PERFORM SHOW-SCREEN UNTIL GOBACK-SW = "Y".
           PERFORM END-PAR.

       END-PAR.
           GOBACK.

       EJECT
       SHOW-SCREEN.
           WRITE TERMINAL-REC FORMAT IS "SCREEN1"
                 INDIC ARE SCREEN-INDICATORS.
           READ TERMINAL-FILE FORMAT IS "SCREEN1"
                 INDIC ARE SCREEN-INDICATORS.

           IF IND (3) = TRUE-VAL
             GO TO END-PAR.

           MOVE ALL B"0" TO SCREEN-INDICATORS.

           IF FILEOPTION OF SCREEN1-O = 1 OR
                                        2 OR
                                        3 OR
                                        7 OR
                                        8 OR
                                        9 OR
                                        10
             NEXT SENTENCE
           ELSE
             MOVE 20 TO CATREAD-MSG-NUMBER
             CALL "CCATREAD" USING CATREAD-PARMS
             MOVE CATREAD-MSG-TEXT TO ERRMSG OF SCREEN1-O
             MOVE TRUE-VAL TO IND (99)
             GO TO SHOW-SCREEN.

           IF FILEOPTION OF SCREEN1-O = 3
             CALL "TMEQP1"   USING CATREAD-PARMS.
